  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing short-term, tangible support to the Bougainville Police Service</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity will assist the Bougainville Police Service to strengthen their corporate services and training&#xa0;capabilities by funding and recruiting in-line positions in human resources and logistics and by funding and managing the upgrade of the Police training center in Buka.
Funding is also allocated to design a framework for&#xa0;New Zealand&apos;s next phase of integrated support to the Bougainville policing sector.</narrative>
  </description>
